    {
      "name": "Deny the Witch",
      "type": "trait",
      "_id": "inqActor13Trait0",
      "img": "modules/impmal-core/assets/icons/blank.webp",
      "system": {
        "notes": {
          "player": "",
          "gm": "<p>When a psyker within Medium Range of the Interrogator Manifests a power, they may use their Reaction to attempt to disrupt it. The Interrogator makes a Willpower Test with the same Difficulty as the Psychic Power. If they succeed, subtract their SL from the psyker's SL. This may reduce their SL below 1 and cause the psychic power to fail.   Extract Truth: Whenever an Interrogator causes a Wound to a Character with a melee attack, they may make an Opposed Test of their Presence (Interrogation) against the Character's Fortitude (Pain). If the Interrogator wins, the party's Superiority decreases by 1.</p>"
        },
